<item>
<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-03T09:46:53.115Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:46:53 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces ended a ten-day operation in Hebron, withdrawing after detaining residents and threatening a broader West Bank offensive, while the IDF killed six Hamas operatives, including two who took part in the Oct 7 attack, and a separate strike in Gaza City killed one person and wounded five. Israeli forces killed four Palestinians in Gaza and a fifth died of wounds, and they arrested six West Bank Palestinians accused of building rockets to launch at Israel. A UN rights office warned of a deepening displacement nightmare in Gaza, and a West Bank school fortified its defences against settler violence. Al Jazeera journalist was released in the occupied West Bank and Al Jazeera condemned an extension of its ban. The UCDP recorded 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168707&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQLTBZcWVBT3pvN3NWMkx6WFVfSlE0MXVQVkNiMU1rdVJoX2l1T2g0ekxzMUVEQUFDNTdpSllxWjBTdzhRRWtNM3FWT3Itdk1HN1hMQU1aX2pWc3lzcXhyZno4Q0ZnSUV5RUlnV3NBeUhSamZDNnlWNUFRZDFfb3VrLWNSMUxnSk1uZEFhaWliMDUzUFdEOG0zUjFIOVpSSFk1VzZuUnV4MlVnODBuSTkxek1KaU5OR1pVdTNZTjE0d1dMTTRuTlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPbUFtUWRCd2YzdnA1RzhnQjRqaHNnZTM2UzRnVTBjYzFoY1N6Ri03UDNERW1tWlp5SVZ6c1hSQU9xdGJ3SFpXRGR0eTZTaXNfajNiRWMxMFBMajFBNXY1ekx4TGJuY3NRVmZJSkRRNHFydTVqbTdtMVJkcXFsTjFkTjRFRU5zcVNpWVM4ZFAzUWNtYjAzaTZEUEViS